@event hs_shadow_late
# en: A Moment Late
title [2e700c] = 慢了半拍
# en: On the stairs by lamplight you wave to a friend and drop your hand, and your shadow on the wall goes on waving a moment longer. Then it lowers its hand, slowly, as if it had only just noticed you were watching. You stand on the stair for a long time. It doesn't move again. Neither do you.
text [e248d2] = 灯光下的楼梯上，你朝一个朋友挥手，然后放下手，可墙上你的影子又多挥了一会儿。接着它慢慢放下手，好像才刚发现你在看着它。你在楼梯上站了很久。它没有再动。你也没有。
# en: A student on a lamplit staircase looking at their own shadow on the wall, which is still raising its hand after theirs has dropped.
scene [6adf27] = 灯光照亮的楼梯上，一个学生看着墙上自己的影子，自己的手已经放下了，影子的手还举着。
# en: Find Seraphine, now
opt.left.label [0da869] = 现在就去找瑟拉芬
# en: She opens her door before you knock, already in her coat. "Yours too," she says. "I painted it last winter. I didn't know whose it was." She won't show you the painting. She does walk you back to your room and makes you leave the lamp lit.
opt.left.say.1 [a97a5d] = 你还没敲门，她就开了门，已经穿好了外套。“你的也是，”她说，“去年冬天我画过它。我不知道是谁的。”她不肯给你看那幅画。不过她一路把你送回房间，让你别熄灯。
# en: Blow the lamp out
opt.right.label [956508] = 吹灭灯
# en: In the dark there are no shadows, and you go up to bed without looking at the walls. You sleep badly. In the morning the frost on your window has melted in the shape of a hand, on the inside of the glass.
opt.right.say.1 [8c6d70] = 黑暗里没有影子，你上楼睡觉，不去看墙。你睡得很糟。早上，你窗上的霜融出了一只手的形状，在玻璃里面那一侧。

@event hs_grey_daylight
# en: In Broad Daylight
title [150ac4] = 光天化日
# en: Noon, the courtyard full, and the man in grey walks in through the gate as if he had an appointment. The fountain freezes, then the flagstones, then the air. Students scramble back against the walls. He stops in front of you. {flag(star_key): "The key," he says pleasantly, holding out a gloved hand. "It was never yours."|"Where is Kael Dumont?" he says pleasantly. "His mother would like a word."}
text [67cf7e] = 正午，庭院里满是人，灰衣人从大门走进来，像是赴一个约。喷泉冻住了，接着是石板，接着是空气。学生们慌忙退到墙边。他在你面前停下。{flag(star_key): “钥匙，”他和颜悦色地说，伸出一只戴手套的手，“它从来就不是你的。”|“凯尔·杜蒙在哪儿？”他和颜悦色地说，“他母亲想和他谈谈。”}
# en: A sunlit courtyard at noon gone silent and frozen, students pressed against the walls, a tall man in grey walking straight across it toward one student.
scene [80df20] = 正午阳光下的庭院一片寂静、冻结，学生们贴着墙，一个穿灰衣的高个子男人径直穿过庭院走向一个学生。
# en: Draw on him, here
opt.fight.label [43758c] = 就在这里对他出杖
# en: Combat, in front of everyone. Lose, and he takes what he came for.
opt.fight.hint [35fb0c] = 战斗，当着所有人的面。输了，他就会拿走他要的东西。
# en: Kael's frost and your spell hit him together, and the man in grey goes skidding back across the ice he made. For the first time he looks surprised. He straightens his coat, bows to the whole courtyard, and walks out of the gate. Then the cheering starts.
opt.fight.say.1 [9bcfde] = 凯尔的霜和你的咒语同时击中了他，灰衣人在他自己造的冰上向后滑了出去。他第一次露出惊讶的神色。他整了整外套，向整个庭院鞠了一躬，走出了大门。然后欢呼声响了起来。
# en: He swats the two of you aside like moths, in front of everyone. {flag(key_taken): When you get up, the key is gone from your pocket, and so is he.|When you get up he is gone, and Kael is bleeding from a cut over his eye that frosts over as you watch.}
opt.fight.say.2 [eb5de7] = 他当着所有人的面，像拍飞蛾一样把你们俩拍到一边。{flag(key_taken): 等你爬起来，钥匙已经不在你口袋里了，他也不在了。|等你爬起来，他已经走了，凯尔眼睛上方的伤口在流血，你眼看着它结上了霜。}
# en: Your spell catches him square and he goes skidding back across the ice he made. For the first time he looks surprised. He straightens his coat, bows to the whole courtyard, and walks out of the gate. Then the cheering starts.
opt.fight.say.3 [c04347] = 你的咒语正中他，他在他自己造的冰上向后滑了出去。他第一次露出惊讶的神色。他整了整外套，向整个庭院鞠了一躬，走出了大门。然后欢呼声响了起来。
# en: He swats your spell aside like a moth, in front of everyone. {flag(key_taken): When you get up, the key is gone from your pocket, and so is he.|When you get up he is gone, and the frost on the flagstones spells out a name: Kael's.}
opt.fight.say.4 [af6d8d] = 他当着所有人的面，像拍飞蛾一样把你的咒语拍到一边。{flag(key_taken): 等你爬起来，钥匙已经不在你口袋里了，他也不在了。|等你爬起来，他已经走了，石板上的霜拼出了一个名字：凯尔。}
# en: Run, and take what he wants with you
opt.hide.label [90131f] = 带上他要的东西，跑
# en: Guile. Half the school is between you and the gate.
opt.hide.hint [bf7915] = 诡计。你和大门之间隔着半个学校的人。
# en: You duck into the crowd and the crowd closes behind you; a dozen first-years suddenly need to cross the courtyard all at once. By the time he has walked through them, you're three corridors away {flag(star_key): with the key|with Kael}, and the bell for lessons is ringing.
opt.hide.say.1 [01312d] = 你钻进人群，人群在你身后合拢；一打一年级生突然同时需要穿过庭院。等他走过他们，你已经{flag(star_key): 带着钥匙|带着凯尔}跑出了三条走廊，上课铃正在响。
# en: He doesn't chase you. He simply arrives, at the end of the corridor, ahead of you. {flag(key_taken): He holds out his hand, and the key leaves your pocket on its own and goes to him.|"Tell him she's coming," he says, and leaves you shaking.}
opt.hide.say.2 [8f5ca1] = 他没有追你。他只是先到了，在走廊尽头，在你前面。{flag(key_taken): 他伸出手，钥匙自己离开你的口袋，到了他那里。|“告诉他，她要来了。”他说完就走了，留下你发抖。}
# en: Shout for the headmistress
opt.call.label [8e6b96] = 大喊院长
# en: Sure. She'll want to know why he came for you.
opt.call.hint [dc25e6] = 一定成功。她会想知道他为什么来找你。
# en: She is there before you finish her name, and the courtyard thaws around her feet. He bows to her and goes. Then she holds out her own hand. "The key," she says, exactly as he did. "For safekeeping." You give it to her.
opt.call.say.1 [401296] = 你还没喊完她的名字，她就到了，庭院在她脚边解冻。他向她鞠了一躬，走了。然后她伸出了自己的手。“钥匙，”她说，和他一模一样，“替你保管。”你把它交给了她。
# en: She is there before you finish her name, and the courtyard thaws around her feet. He bows to her and goes. Kael, who heard the whole thing from a window, doesn't speak to you for a week: "You told her he was looking for me."
opt.call.say.2 [67e092] = 你还没喊完她的名字，她就到了，庭院在她脚边解冻。他向她鞠了一躬，走了。凯尔在窗边听见了这一切，一整周没和你说话：“你告诉她他在找我。”

@event hs_key_recover
# en: Getting It Back
title [1e5dab] = 把它拿回来
# en: The man in grey has the star key, and by now the whole academy knows it. He has taken the top room at the Gilded Newt, and the landlord says he never seems to sleep. The headmistress has said nothing to you. Kael hasn't stopped saying things. There are ways to get it back, and none of them involve asking him nicely.
text [fbf9ca] = 灰衣人拿着星钥，现在全学院都知道了。他住进了镀金蝾螈酒馆的顶楼房间，老板说他好像从来不睡觉。院长对你什么也没说。凯尔则说个不停。有办法把它拿回来，只是没有一种是好好地开口请他还。
# en: A narrow upstairs corridor of a village inn at night, a door with frost on its handle, a student with a candle hesitating outside it.
scene [943194] = 夜里村中旅店楼上的一条窄走廊，一扇门把手上结着霜，一个学生举着蜡烛在门外犹豫。
# en: Go to the headmistress
opt.isolde.label [c956ad] = 去找院长
# en: She'll get it back, and keep it until the night.
opt.isolde.hint [12a812] = 她会拿回来，并保管到那一夜。
# en: She listens without a word, then puts on her coat. In the morning the key is on her desk, and there is frost on her sleeve up to the elbow. "He was polite about it," she says. "They always are." She doesn't give it back to you.
opt.isolde.say.1 [18009b] = 她一言不发地听完，然后穿上了外套。第二天早上，钥匙就在她桌上，她的袖子上一直到手肘都是霜。“他倒是很有礼貌，”她说，“他们向来如此。”她没有把钥匙还给你。
# en: Steal it back from the Newt
opt.steal.label [44f3ab] = 从酒馆把它偷回来
# en: Guile. He never seems to sleep.
opt.steal.hint [56e6b3] = 诡计。他好像从来不睡。
# en: He is sitting up in the dark with his eyes open, and he doesn't see you. The key is on the windowsill, in a dish of snow. You take it, and back out, and don't breathe until you're on the road.
opt.steal.say.1 [c75c6b] = 他睁着眼坐在黑暗里，却没看见你。钥匙在窗台上，放在一碟雪里。你拿起它，退出来，直到走上大路才敢喘气。
# en: The landing creaks. He says "Good evening" through the closed door, and the cold comes under it like water. You run, and slip on the stairs, and arrive home with a sprained wrist and nothing else.
opt.steal.say.2 [fce807] = 楼梯平台嘎吱一响。他隔着关着的门说了声“晚上好”，寒气像水一样从门底下漫过来。你跑了，在楼梯上滑了一跤，回到家时只多了一只扭伤的手腕。
# en: Ask a Dumont where he'd keep it
opt.family.label [b1704d] = 问杜蒙家的人他会藏在哪儿
# en: Charm. Kael or Ilse know how the families hide things.
opt.family.hint [ca6a0c] = 魅力。凯尔或伊尔泽知道那些家族怎么藏东西。
# en: "Snow," says {flag(ilse_saved): Ilse|Kael}, at once. "He'll keep it in snow, so it can't call to anyone." It's on his windowsill, in a dish of it. The Dumont who told you stands lookout in the lane while you climb, and doesn't say a word on the way home.
opt.family.say.1 [d0043f] = “雪里，”{flag(ilse_saved): 伊尔泽|凯尔}立刻说，“他会把它放在雪里，这样它就没法呼唤任何人。”它就在他的窗台上，放在一碟雪里。告诉你的那个杜蒙在巷子里替你望风，回去的路上一句话也没说。
# en: "I don't know," {flag(ilse_saved): Ilse|Kael} says, too quickly, and won't look at you. Whatever the families do with what they take, it isn't something they want to tell you. Not yet.
opt.family.say.2 [5629f1] = “我不知道。”{flag(ilse_saved): 伊尔泽|凯尔}说得太快了，也不看你。不管那些家族怎么处置他们拿走的东西，那都不是他们想告诉你的事。还不是时候。
# en: Let Edmund's wand find it
opt.wand.label [724195] = 让埃德蒙的魔杖去找
# en: Arcana. The wand hums near anything the founders made.
opt.wand.hint [4b2c87] = 奥术。这根魔杖靠近创始者造的任何东西都会嗡鸣。
# en: The silver wand drags at your hand like a dog on a lead, all the way to the Newt and up the back stairs, and goes quiet beside a dish of snow on a windowsill. The man in grey is out. The key is not.
opt.wand.say.1 [c757e8] = 银魔杖像拴着绳的狗一样拽着你的手，一路拽到酒馆，拽上后楼梯，在窗台上的一碟雪旁安静下来。灰衣人出去了。钥匙没有。
# en: The wand hums, and wavers, and points at the lake every time. Wherever he's keeping it, it's near the water, and you can't follow it there. Not tonight.
opt.wand.say.2 [1de714] = 魔杖嗡鸣着，摇摆着，每次都指向湖。不管他把它藏在哪里，都在水边，而你没法跟到那里去。今晚不行。
# en: Not yet
opt.wait.label [8dd27c] = 还不是时候
# en: It'll keep. He will too.
opt.wait.hint [0673fb] = 它跑不了。他也跑不了。
# en: You leave it for now. Every night you can feel it from across the village, cold, the way you feel a draught from a door left open.
opt.wait.say.1 [a760bf] = 你暂时放下了。每天夜里你都能隔着整个村子感觉到它，冷冷的，就像感觉到一扇没关的门透进来的风。
